 /*
+ * HttpServer.prototype.sendFile(requestId, status, headersArray, path,
+ *                                offset, length, headOnly) -> boolean
+ *
+ * Zero-copy whole-file response.  Returns false when nothing has been written
+ * and the caller must fall back to the JS stream; returns true when the
+ * response has been taken over (headers queued, body follows from the
+ * writable callback).
